{"4937380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starspire Hunters", "steam_appid": 4937380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starspire Hunters</strong> is a side-scrolling Incremental Action RPG where you play as the Rookie, a fresh, bottom-tier Hunter with no remarkable talents and everything to prove. Struggle against monsters, unlock even the most basic abilities, and turn humble beginnings into legendary power as you climb a mysterious tower filled with bizarre biomes, deadly bosses, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove the doubters wrong, earn your place in the Starspire Hunters Guild, and rise from the weakest hunter into a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/83d2b74d30151569128d2e45c87ffed8.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/93836076f892ed6c20c06375462fa774.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/93836076f892ed6c20c06375462fa774.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/93836076f892ed6c20c06375462fa774.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long before humanity's first breath, a colossal, otherworldly, and monolithic structure appeared in the realm of Velmoria. Once believed to be one of the greatest wonders of the world, its ancient doors have finally been opened, revealing a sprawling, reality-bending labyrinth filled with bizarre monsters, unique biomes, hidden secrets, and an unsolved mystery whose truth will change Velmoria forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/4a52abcb84e5f9efa969c75aed831d08.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/f27f10022c3921b181360aa873d64071.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/f27f10022c3921b181360aa873d64071.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/f27f10022c3921b181360aa873d64071.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a plethora of strange, otherworldly creatures that roam the floors of the Starspire. Every floor introduces new enemies with unique quirks, and the higher you climb, the deadlier they become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/77ef58c953203b506c292bd829324c33.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/7130f5dacba25f9f1f0ea059ad8a9427.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/7130f5dacba25f9f1f0ea059ad8a9427.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/7130f5dacba25f9f1f0ea059ad8a9427.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather valuable monster drops and sell them on the bustling Starspire Grand Market to earn Spirol, Velmoria's primary currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/f5bf56e6d356c24eec099e69ad0f74a0.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/253e30ca43653b1375ccd5034de87752.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/253e30ca43653b1375ccd5034de87752.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/253e30ca43653b1375ccd5034de87752.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine ore deposits scattered throughout the Starspire, refine them into valuable bars, and forge stronger equipment and unlock more powerful upgrades to help you climb higher.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/93ae05809f49afb23aef78fbcf625522.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/b2570cdc19eb0351120ac2b5a029ad9c.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/b2570cdc19eb0351120ac2b5a029ad9c.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/b2570cdc19eb0351120ac2b5a029ad9c.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard earned spirol to unlock powerful upgrades across six unique tech trees. Strengthen your abilities, expand your options, and prepare yourself for the challenges waiting higher within the Starspire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/1cf0a4a262fb8d534c3a0f6db7f65b7f.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/949b7e98c86893849db4cad38cd39c1a.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/949b7e98c86893849db4cad38cd39c1a.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/949b7e98c86893849db4cad38cd39c1a.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invented by the Hunters Guild's eccentric Professor A.E. Stooge after the government slashed their funding, the Junk-A-Tron transforms monster drops into bizarre novelty inventions. Sell your creations on the Grand Market for massive profits and fund your journey deeper into the Starspire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/cd3bc8a98d6e9f846dcfd0b3d95f42e2.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/864328ba75072df6bc197f8f43c6c851.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/864328ba75072df6bc197f8f43c6c851.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/864328ba75072df6bc197f8f43c6c851.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth to the Starspire Hunters Guild and choose from specialized Combat Classes, each with its own unique abilities and play-style. Gain powerful abilities that will redefine how you fight your way through the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/61510f2548eac45bc00cf44e973c2ff7.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/4bd2e0054b4489db808da9ce74c6932f.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/4bd2e0054b4489db808da9ce74c6932f.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/4bd2e0054b4489db808da9ce74c6932f.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome ends with a powerful, otherwordly boss encounter. The Sentinels guard the secrets of the Starspire. Defeat them to unlock new areas and uncover an origin beyond anything Velmoria has ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/cefb99c62436418e6309206f28dab223.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a young rookie and grow into the legendary hunter the Starspire Hunters Guild desperately needs. Brave the bizarre depths of the labyrinth, push past the uncharted sixth floor, and uncover the cosmic mystery looming over the Starspire. What is its true nature? The answers await within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starspire Hunters</strong> is a side-scrolling Incremental Action RPG where you play as the Rookie, a fresh, bottom-tier Hunter with no remarkable talents and everything to prove. Struggle against monsters, unlock even the most basic abilities, and turn humble beginnings into legendary power as you climb a mysterious tower filled with bizarre biomes, deadly bosses, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove the doubters wrong, earn your place in the Starspire Hunters Guild, and rise from the weakest hunter into a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/83d2b74d30151569128d2e45c87ffed8.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/93836076f892ed6c20c06375462fa774.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=658 ><s