extras/949b7e98c86893849db4cad38cd39c1a.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/949b7e98c86893849db4cad38cd39c1a.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invented by the Hunters Guild's eccentric Professor A.E. Stooge after the government slashed their funding, the Junk-A-Tron transforms monster drops into bizarre novelty inventions. Sell your creations on the Grand Market for massive profits and fund your journey deeper into the Starspire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/cd3bc8a98d6e9f846dcfd0b3d95f42e2.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/864328ba75072df6bc197f8f43c6c851.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/864328ba75072df6bc197f8f43c6c851.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/864328ba75072df6bc197f8f43c6c851.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth to the Starspire Hunters Guild and choose from specialized Combat Classes, each with its own unique abilities and play-style. Gain powerful abilities that will redefine how you fight your way through the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/61510f2548eac45bc00cf44e973c2ff7.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/4bd2e0054b4489db808da9ce74c6932f.poster.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/4bd2e0054b4489db808da9ce74c6932f.webm?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/4bd2e0054b4489db808da9ce74c6932f.mp4?t=1785664629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome ends with a powerful, otherwordly boss encounter. The Sentinels guard the secrets of the Starspire. Defeat them to unlock new areas and uncover an origin beyond anything Velmoria has ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/extras/cefb99c62436418e6309206f28dab223.avif?t=1785664629\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a young rookie and grow into the legendary hunter the Starspire Hunters Guild desperately needs. Brave the bizarre depths of the labyrinth, push past the uncharted sixth floor, and uncover the cosmic mystery looming over the Starspire. What is its true nature? The answers await within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Start as a broke rookie Hunter and claw your way to godlike power! Hunt monsters, craft powerful weapons, unlock incredible abilities, and climb the mysterious Starspire in this charming side-scrolling Incremental Action RPG.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4937380/db3f012